<section><p class="eyebrow">RESTCLIENT.NET / JOURNAL</p><h1>Ideas worth building on.</h1><p>Types, tools, and the craft of building reliable software.</p><div class="grid">{% for post in collections.posts %}<article class="feature-card"><small>{{ post.date | dateFormat }} · {{ post.data.author }}</small><h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2><p>{{ post.data.excerpt or post.data.description }}</p><a href="{{ post.url }}">Read article ↗</a></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
